db - A SQL database in C (tracks/db)
------------------------------------

Upstream   SQLite, https://sqlite.org/src
           (GitHub mirror: https://github.com/sqlite/sqlite)
Licence    Public domain (https://sqlite.org/copyright.html)
Taken      No code. The engine follows SQLite's documented database file
